Package: pegs
Type: Package
Title: Pseudo-Expectation Gauss-Seidel
Version: 0.1
Date: 2025-11-26
Maintainer: Alencar Xavier <alenxav@gmail.com>
Authors@R: c(person("Alencar", "Xavier", role=c("aut", "cre"), email = "alenxav@gmail.com", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5034-9954")), person("David", "Habier", role=c("aut")))
Description: Lightweight, dependency-free, simplified implementation of the Pseudo-Expectation Gauss-Seidel (PEGS) algorithm used as a multivariate genomic prediction models (<doi:10.1186/s12711-022-00730-w>, <doi:10.1093/genetics/iyae179>).
